/-!
# Form-native P286 gauge derivative integration by parts

This module proves the arbitrary compactly supported P286 connection identity

`integral W22_P286(B, d a) = integral W13_P286(a, d B)`.

Only the exterior-derivative channel is present.  The direct `d a` carrier is
proved equal to the actual derivative channel generated by the primitive
connection path before the integrated seam is exported.  No historical
volume/Hodge BF momentum, action equation, current, residual zero,
stationarity receipt, constitutive inverse, source branch, or target solution
is imported.
-/

